{
  "episode": 80,
  "source": "assets/video/ep80.mp4",
  "model": "base",
  "duration": 319.1583125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.0,
      "text": "Journey to the West, Chapter 80, the small Thunder Clap monastery."
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 13.0,
      "end": 17.0,
      "text": "One afternoon, Wukong and his companions were resting by a stream."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 18.0,
      "end": 20.0,
      "text": "They were eating peaches and berries."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 21.0,
      "end": 23.0,
      "text": "We must be getting close to the Western paradise."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 24.0,
      "end": 25.0,
      "text": "Said the Tang monk."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 26.0,
      "end": 27.0,
      "text": "We've been traveling for years."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 27.0,
      "end": 31.0,
      "text": "I feel like we've been traveling for thousands of years."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 31.0,
      "end": 32.0,
      "text": "Said Bajay."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 33.0,
      "end": 35.0,
      "text": "We still have a long way to go."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 35.0,
      "end": 36.0,
      "text": "Said Wukong."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 37.0,
      "end": 42.0,
      "text": "But don't worry, eventually we'll arrive in the Western paradise and climb up the Spirit Mountain."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 43.0,
      "end": 47.0,
      "text": "Boot is home, the Thunder Clap monastery sits halfway up the mountain."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 48.0,
      "end": 50.0,
      "text": "The Tang monk took a bite of his peach."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 51.0,
      "end": 54.0,
      "text": "The Thunder Clap monastery must be wonderful to see."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 55.0,
      "end": 58.0,
      "text": "The monastery is spectacular."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 58.0,
      "end": 59.0,
      "text": "Said the monkey."
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 60.0,
      "end": 61.0,
      "text": "Golden light shines from it."
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 63.0,
      "end": 64.0,
      "text": "Bajay moaned."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 65.0,
      "end": 69.0,
      "text": "So we're going to have to climb a mountain at the end of this journey?"
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 70.0,
      "end": 72.0,
      "text": "Just thinking about that makes me tired."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 73.0,
      "end": 74.0,
      "text": "Wukong stroked his chin."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 75.0,
      "end": 77.0,
      "text": "I really hope the journey ends soon."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 78.0,
      "end": 79.0,
      "text": "The pig nodded."
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 80.0,
      "end": 81.0,
      "text": "You're tired of traveling too?"
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 82.0,
      "end": 83.0,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 83.0,
      "end": 85.0,
      "text": "Said Wujing with a serious look."
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 86.0,
      "end": 88.0,
      "text": "I'm just tired of hearing you complain."
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 90.0,
      "end": 92.0,
      "text": "Everyone was quiet for a moment."
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 93.0,
      "end": 97.0,
      "text": "Then Wujing's face broke into a smile and everybody laughed."
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 98.0,
      "end": 99.0,
      "text": "Even Bajay."
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 100.0,
      "end": 102.0,
      "text": "Very funny, Wujing."
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 103.0,
      "end": 105.0,
      "text": "Said Bajay. The Tang monk stood up."
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 106.0,
      "end": 109.0,
      "text": "We should go. I'd like to find a village or a monastery before dark."
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 110.0,
      "end": 114.0,
      "text": "A couple of hours later, they were traveling up a mountain road."
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 115.0,
      "end": 117.0,
      "text": "The road curved around a bend."
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 121.0,
      "end": 124.0,
      "text": "A head they could see a small monastery."
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 125.0,
      "end": 126.0,
      "text": "The Tang monk gasped."
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 127.0,
      "end": 129.0,
      "text": "Is that the Thunder Clap monastery?"
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 130.0,
      "end": 131.0,
      "text": "It might be."
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 132.0,
      "end": 133.0,
      "text": "Said Bajay."
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 134.0,
      "end": 135.0,
      "text": "Golden light is shining from it."
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 136.0,
      "end": 137.0,
      "text": "It's on a mountain."
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 137.0,
      "end": 138.0,
      "text": "Wujing added."
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 139.0,
      "end": 140.0,
      "text": "Wukong laughed."
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 141.0,
      "end": 143.0,
      "text": "It's not the Thunder Clap monastery."
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 144.0,
      "end": 146.0,
      "text": "We're not even in the Western Paradise yet."
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 147.0,
      "end": 149.0,
      "text": "The monkey peered at the monastery for a moment."
    }
  ]
}
